{"id":403,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Shakes its body to generate electricity. Its stature belies its aggression—one must be patient to tame this Pokémon."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Electricity makes this Pokémon’s fur glow. Shinx sends signals to others of its kind by shaking the tip of its tail while the tail tip is shining brightly."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon generates electricity by contracting its muscles. Excited trembling is a sign that Shinx is generating a tremendous amount of electricity."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. Its fur glows when it’s in trouble."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Its forelegs have a muscle-based system of generating electricity. Its body shines if endangered."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."},{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Guts","hidden":true,"description":"It's so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":403,"name":"Shinx","condition":null,"children":[{"id":404,"name":"Luxio","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[{"id":405,"name":"Luxray","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":